diligence do you run before I buy?`,a:`Lease review, ABC license history, code/permit status, sales verification, equipment condition, vendor contracts, and prior Health inspection records. See our Restaurant Business Investigations page.`},{q:`Can I use an E-2 investor visa to buy a restaurant?`,a:`Yes. We package E-2-ready acquisitions for European entrepreneurs — see our E-2 Visa page.`}],ld=()=>E(()=>import(`./buy-a-restaurant-BLnn1BdU.js`),__vite__mapDeps([27,3,2,4])),ud=`https://www.penthouseadvisors.com/buy-a-restaurant`,dd=D(`/buy-a-restaurant`)({head:()=>({meta:[{title:`Buy a Restaurant in Los Angeles | Penthouse Advisors`},{name:`description`,content:`Buy a restaurant in Los Angeles County with a full-service brokerage. Off-market sourcing, ABC license transfers, lease review, and Health Dept clearance.`},{property:`og:title`,content:`Buy a Restaurant in Los Angeles | Penthouse Advisors`},{property:`og:description`,content:`Full-service restaurant acquisitions across LA County.`},{property:`og:url`,content:ud},{property:`og:type`,content:`website`},{name:`twitter:card`,content:`summary_large_image`}],links:[{rel:`canonical`,href:ud}],scripts:il({name:`Restaurant Acquisitions — Los Angeles`,serviceType:`Restaurant Business Broker`,description:`Full-service restaurant buyer representation across Los Angeles County.`,url:ud,breadcrumbs:[{name:`Home`,url:`https://www.penthouseadvisors.com`},{name:`Services`,url:`https://www.penthouseadvisors.com/services`},{name:`Buy a Restaurant`,url:ud}],faqs:cd})}),component:w(ld,`component`)}),fd=D(`/business-investigations`)({head:()=>({meta:[{title:`Restaurant Business Investigations | Penthouse Advisors`},{name:`description`,content:`Pre-purchase restaurant due diligence: lease terms, permit history, sales verification, ABC status, code violations, hidden landlord and disclosure issues - before you sign.`},{property:`og:title`,content:`Restaurant Business Investigations - Penthouse Advisors`},{property:`og:description`,